# Frontend environment (Vite). Copy to `.env.local` and adjust if needed.
#
# Leave empty for the normal setup: the SPA and the Worker share one origin
# (ADR-001), and `vite.config.ts` proxies /api to http://localhost:8787.
#
# Only set this when the SPA is served from a DIFFERENT origin than the API,
# for example a preview deploy against a staging Worker. Never commit a real
# production URL here.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
